# TiBillet module - English
ModuleTiBilletName = TiBillet
TiBilletDescription = Imports TiBillet cash closures into the general ledger every night (entries not validated).
TiBilletTacheCommentaire = Imports TiBillet closures into the general ledger. Does nothing until the address and key are set (Setup → Modules → TiBillet).
TiBilletReglages = TiBillet settings
TiBilletExplication = Every night at 02:30, Dolibarr fetches the venue's daily closures it does not have yet from TiBillet. It creates the missing accounts and journals, then writes the entries into the general ledger, <b>not validated</b>: your accountant reviews, then validates them.
TiBilletAdresse = TiBillet venue address
TiBilletAdresseAide = Example: https://myvenue.tibillet.coop (the venue's main address, https)
TiBilletCle = TiBillet API key
TiBilletCleAide = Created in TiBillet's admin (API keys), with only the "Accounting (read)" right. Leave empty to keep the saved key.
TiBilletCleDefinie = A key is saved.
TiBilletCleAbsente = No key saved.
TiBilletReseauLocal = Development mode
TiBilletReseauLocalAide = Only for a test on a development machine: name read from /etc/hosts, certificate not checked, http allowed. Keep unchecked in production.
TiBilletEnregistrer = Save
TiBilletTester = Test the connection
TiBilletImporterMaintenant = Import now
TiBilletReimporter = Re-import
TiBilletReimporterAide = Removes this closure's entries and writes them again with TiBillet's current chart of accounts. Impossible if a line is validated.
TiBilletReglagesEnregistres = Settings saved.
TiBilletClotureReimportee = Closure re-imported.
TiBilletClotures = Imported closures
TiBilletNumero = Closure no.
TiBilletDateComptable = Entries date
TiBilletDateImport = Imported on
TiBilletPieces = Pieces
TiBilletAucuneCloture = No closure imported yet.
TiBilletNonConfigure = Module not configured: fill in the venue address and the API key (Setup → Modules → TiBillet).
TiBilletConnexionOk = Connection OK: TiBillet returns %s accounts.
TiBilletResume = %s closure(s) imported (no. %s), %s account(s) created, %s journal(s) created.
TiBilletCleRefusee = Key refused by TiBillet (403): check the key, the "Accounting (read)" right and the key's IP address.
TiBilletInjoignable = TiBillet cannot be reached: %s
TiBilletRefus = TiBillet refused (%s): %s
TiBilletAdresseInvalide = The TiBillet venue address is not valid.
TiBilletHttpsObligatoire = The TiBillet venue address must start with https:// (the key never travels in clear).
TiBilletReponseIllisible = Unreadable answer from TiBillet.
TiBilletExerciceFerme = No open fiscal year for %s (TiBillet closure no. %s). Open or reopen the fiscal year (Accounting → Setup → Fiscal years), then run the import again. The following closures wait.
TiBilletPasDePlanComptable = No active chart of accounts in Dolibarr (Accounting → Setup → Chart of accounts).
TiBilletEcritureDejaPresente = Entry %s is already in the general ledger: nothing is written again.
TiBilletEcritureDesequilibree = Entry %s is not balanced: nothing is written.
TiBilletReimportRefuseValidee = Closure no. %s: a line is already validated, it cannot be re-imported.
TiBilletReimportRefuseExercice = Closure no. %s: some of its lines could not be removed (closed fiscal year?). Nothing changed.
TiBilletClotureInconnue = Unknown closure.
TiBilletErreurDolibarr = Dolibarr error: %s
